e way — bolos and old rifles in their hands. They are not Spanish. But they do not look friendly either.)"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":205,"indent":0,"parameters":[2,{"list":[{"code":1,"indent":null,"parameters":[]},{"code":1,"indent":null,"parameters":[]}],"repeat":false,"skippable":false,"wait":true},false]},{"code":205,"indent":0,"parameters":[3,{"list":[{"code":1,"indent":null,"parameters":[]},{"code":1,"indent":null,"parameters":[]}],"repeat":false,"skippable":false,"wait":true},false]},{"code":230,"indent":0,"parameters":[20]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["\\n<Guard> Hold! Two strangers coming from the north — in the middle of a war. Where do you think you are going?"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["\\n<Florante> South. To San Francisco de Malabon. We fought with the Supremo at San Juan del Monte."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["\\n<Guard> The Supremo? Hah. The Supremo lost. And we are supposed to take your word for it?"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["(The guard measures them, then spits on the ground.)"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["\\n<Guard> The commander decides what happens to strangers. Mariano Trias does not welcome guests with open arms. Come."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["(The guards escort them through the town. The municipal building looms ahead.)"]},{"code":205,"indent":0,"parameters":[2,{"list":[{"code":4,"indent":null,"parameters":[]},{"code":4,"indent":null,"parameters":[]}],"repeat":false,"skippable":false,"wait":true},false]},{"code":205,"indent":0,"parameters":[3,{"list":[{"code":4,"indent":null,"parameters":[]},{"code":4,"indent":null,"parameters":[]}],"repeat":false,"skippable":false,"wait":true},false]},{"code":230,"inde